{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36548","headline":"冬日庙中书事呈栖白上人 · 罗邺","name":"冬日庙中书事呈栖白上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日高荒庙掩双扉，杉迳无人鸟雀悲。\n昨日江潮起归思，满窗风雨觉来时。\n何堪身计长如此，闲尽炉灰却是疑。\n赖有碧云吟句客，禅余相访说新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}